<title>BELGIUM: Coceral to correct 1997 German winter barley area.</title>
<headline>Coceral to correct 1997 German winter barley area.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coceral, the EU grain trade lobby, said on Friday it was correcting its forecast of 1997 German winter barley plantings.</p>
<p>&quot;The German barley figure is much too low,&quot; a Coceral official told Reuters.</p>
<p>In a preliminary forecast of the 1997 EU winter grain area, Coceral put German barley sowings at 827,000 hectares, against 795,000 last year.</p>
</text>
